<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>Frequently Asked Questions | Web and Design Services</title>
    <meta name="description"content="Find answers about web design, branding, project timelines, revisions, and post-launch support for startups and small businesses.">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../css/component/faq.css">
</head>


<body>

    <main class="roadmap-container">


        <!-- =========================
             PAGE HEADER
        ========================== -->

        <header class="roadmap-header">

            <h1>Frequently Asked Questions</h1>

        </header>



        <!-- =========================
             ROADMAP STEPS
        ========================== -->

        <section class="roadmap">

            <!-- =========================
                 STEP 1
            ========================== -->

            <article class="step-card" id="step-1">
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number">1</div>
                    <div class="step-title-area">
                        <h2 class="step-title">Do you work with startups and small businesses?</h2>
                        <p class="step-time">Yes. We work with businesses, startups, and individuals.</p>

                    </div>

                </div>


                <p class="step-description">Whether you are launching a new business or improving an existing one, we tailor the project scope to your goals, audience, requirements, and budget.</p>


                <h3 class="info-heading">Who We Work With</h3>
                <ul class="resources">
                    <li>Startups</li>
                    <li>Small businesses</li>
                    <li>Personal Brands</li>
                    <li>Online Stores</li>
                    <li>Individuals</li>
                </ul>

            </article>



            <!-- =========================
                 STEP 2
            ========================== -->

            <article class="step-card" id="step-2" hidden>
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number">2</div>
                    <div class="step-title-area">
                        <h2 class="step-title">How do I choose the right service?</h2>
                        <p class="step-time">We help you find the best fit for your goals.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <p class="step-description">Tell us what you want to achieve, who you want to reach, and what you need built. We will recommend an approach that fits your project instead of pushing a one-size-fits-all package.</p>
                <h3 class="info-heading">Services We Can Help With</h3>

                <ul class="resources">
                    <li>Website design and development</li>
                    <li>Logo and brand identity</li>
                    <li>UI/UX design</li>
                    <li>Graphic design</li>
                    <li>E-commerce solutions</li>
                    <li>Custom digital projects</li>
                </ul>

            </article>



            <!-- =========================
                 STEP 3
            ========================== -->

            <article class="step-card" id="step-3" hidden>

                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number">3</div>
                    <div class="step-title-area">
                        <h2 class="step-title">What do you need before we get started?</h2>
                        <p class="step-time">A few project details help us plan the right solution.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>


                <p class="step-description">You do not need to have everything figured out. Sharing the basics gives us a clear starting point, and we can work through any open questions together.</p>

                <h3 class="info-heading">Helpful Project Details</h3>
                <ul class="resources">
                    <li>Your business and project goals</li>
                    <li>Target audience</li>
                    <li>Required pages, features, or deliverables</li>
                    <li>Content, images, and brand guidelines</li>
                    <li>Examples or references you like</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <!-- =========================
                 STEP 4
            ========================== -->

            <article class="step-card" id="step-4" hidden>
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number">4</div>
                    <div class="step-title-area">
                        <h2 class="step-title">How long will my project take?</h2>
                        <p class="step-time">We set a clear timeline after we understand the scope.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
                <p class="step-description">Timing depends on the size and complexity of the work, how quickly content is ready, and the feedback process. We will agree on milestones and a target timeline before work begins.</p>
                <h3 class="info-heading">What Shapes the Timeline</h3>
                <ul class="resources">
                    <li>Project scope and number of pages</li>
                    <li>Features and technical complexity</li>
                    <li>Design and content requirements</li>
                    <li>Content readiness</li>
                    <li>Review and revision rounds</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <!-- =========================
                 STEP 5
            ========================== -->

            <article class="step-card" id="step-5" hidden>
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number"> 5</div>
                    <div class="step-title-area">
                        <h2 class="step-title">Can I request design changes?</h2>
                        <p class="step-time">Yes. Feedback and revisions are part of the process.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>


                <p class="step-description">We use your feedback to refine the work and keep it aligned with your goals and brand. The number and scope of revision rounds are agreed upon as part of your project.</p>

                <h3 class="info-heading">What You Can Refine</h3>
                <ul class="resources">
                    <li>Colors and typography</li>
                    <li>Layout and page structure</li>
                    <li>Images and visual assets</li>
                    <li>Content and design details</li>
                </ul>
            </article>

            <!-- =========================
                 STEP 6
            ========================== -->

            <article class="step-card" id="step-6" hidden>
                <div class="step-header">
                    <div class="step-number"> 6</div>
                    <div class="step-title-area">
                        <h2 class="step-title">Do you provide support after delivery?</h2>
                        <p class="step-time">Post-launch support may be arranged for your project.</p>
                    </div>

                </div>

                <p class="step-description">We can help with updates and improvements after launch. Available support depends on the service and support arrangement agreed for your project.</p>

                <h3 class="info-heading">Possible Support</h3>
                <ul class="resources">
                    <li>Website and content updates</li>
                    <li>Bug fixes and troubleshooting</li>
                    <li>Maintenance and technical assistance</li>
                    <li>Design improvements</li>
                </ul>

            </article>

            <section class="roadmap-step-selector" aria-label="Select a roadmap step">
                <button class="step-nav-button" type="button" data-step="0" aria-controls="step-1"
                    aria-pressed="true">1</button>
                <button class="step-nav-button" type="button" data-step="1" aria-controls="step-2"
                    aria-pressed="false">2</button>
                <button class="step-nav-button" type="button" data-step="2" aria-controls="step-3"
                    aria-pressed="false">3</button>
                <button class="step-nav-button" type="button" data-step="3" aria-controls="step-4"
                    aria-pressed="false">4</button>
                <button class="step-nav-button" type="button" data-step="4" aria-controls="step-5"
                    aria-pressed="false">5</button>
                <button class="step-nav-button" type="button" data-step="5" aria-controls="step-6"
                    aria-pressed="false">6</button>
            </section>
        </section>
    </main>

    <script>
        const stepButtons = document.querySelectorAll(".step-nav-button");
        const stepCards = document.querySelectorAll(".step-card");

        stepButtons.forEach((button) => {
            button.addEventListener("click", () => {
                const selectedStep = Number(button.dataset.step);
                stepCards.forEach((card, index) => {
                    card.hidden = index !== selectedStep;
                });

                stepButtons.forEach((stepButton, index) => {
                    stepButton.setAttribute("aria-pressed", String(index === selectedStep));
                });
            });
        });
    </script>

</body>
</html>